tisfied as long as our  national security agencies  still seem more obsessed with us than  those that are killing us  the vigil paused for a moment of silence  at 8 40 p.m local time  the same moment two days earlier as the  attack on the afzal family  who went out for a walk and never made  it home  zain basravi al-jazeera
 

